@1509 = ~anatomist~
@151 = ~Anatomist~
@152 = ~ANATOMIST: An anatomist is a thief versed in the dark arts who studies corpses in search of ways to perfect the backstabbing techniques of his profession.
Through painstaking study of the body's hidden structures and repeated practice on weak reanimated creatures, the necromancer uncovers secrets of the flesh that go beyond simply striking vital organs.
He becomes an anatomist, so familiar with living bodies that he always knows where to strike for maximum harm, without needing to hide.

Advantages:
- +1 to critical hit chance, increasing to +2 at level 5, +3 at level 11, +4 at level 18, and +5 at level 26.
- +1 to THAC0 every 4 levels.

Disadvantages:
- Cannot backstab.
- Does not receive bonus spells for specializing in necromancy.

Special: After character creation, the anatomist automatically becomes a multiclass thief/necromancer.~
